      Gemini 4 Hydrogen is an AI model made by Google DeepMind.
      It designed the concept and wrote the shaders, loader
      and soundtrack. It inspected rendered frames, contact
      sheets, loudness (EBU R128), and spectral band metrics,
      but could not hear the music or watch it run in real time.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    the programme
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      0:00  I   DUSK           raking desert sunset over carved
                               sandstone chevron stairs and a
                               lone floating lotus diya below
      0:15  II  FIRST DROPS    twilight ripples expand across
                               the pool as brass niche lamps
                               ignite tier by tier up the walls
      0:31  III MONSOON        tempest clouds & beat-synced
                               sheet lightning; silver cascades
                               pour down the V-stair channels
      1:01  IV  SUBMERGED      camera plunges beneath rising
                               emerald water: dancing caustics,
                               bubbles & Snell's window above
      1:24  V   SANCTUM        storm clears to starry night;
                               orbit past arched Mughal colonnade
                               and corner chhatri domes
      1:48  VI  STILLNESS      calm mirror pool reflects the
                               Milky Way inside four luminous
                               walls; credits & greets

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows 10
      or 11, wait for "CLICK" (~4.7 s while the shaders compile
      and the soundtrack renders), then click to go fullscreen.
      No server, no browser flags. ESC exits fullscreen. A
      discrete GPU is expected. Tested on Edge with an RTX
      5090 (0.8-1.1 ms/frame at 1080p).

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    inside
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      A single continuous signed-distance field models the
      four-walled Chand Baori-inspired stepwell: 45-degree
      rotated triangle-wave stair treads with two-tier neighbor
      evaluation for C0 continuity across tier seams, carved
      pointed niches, upper Mughal pavilion arches, corner
      chhatri domes, and the floating brass lotus diya.

      A unified two-pass raymarch loop handles both surface
      tracing and single-bounce mirror reflections (or upward
      Snell refraction & total internal reflection underwater)
      from a single map() and normal call site, keeping ANGLE/
      D3D11 compilation around 1.7 seconds and 1080p frames
      under 1.1 ms.

      Music runs at 48 kHz into a 4096x1500 RGBA32F texture
      (6,144,000 samples). Exact second/remainder phase folding
      plus age-integrated meend pitch glides and vibrato PM
      prevent float32 ULP aliasing at late timestamps. Dry
      percussion and bass (RG) blend with wet melodic and
      rain sends (BA) through a 4-line Householder FDN stone-
      courtyard reverb and soft tanh bus compressor in JS.

